---
---
<section class="section bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/10 py-16">
  <div class="container-custom slide-up text-center">
    <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-300 font-medium text-sm mb-6">
      Preview Visualizations
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
      Sample Energy Footprints
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      These are preview visualizations of carbon and water footprints based on our energy data. <br> Not interactive dashboards, but a glimpse of the insights you can explore.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="relative rounded-xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <video 
          src="/videos/carbon_footprint_h264.mp4"
          autoplay 
          loop 
          muted 
          playsInline 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        ></video>
      </div>
      <div class="relative rounded-xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <video 
          src="/videos/water_footprint_h264.mp4"
          autoplay 
          loop 
          muted 
          playsInline 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        ></video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
